# Audio-only trim, batch 01 of 12: input methods, printing, the snap store, and other stock-desktop leaks.
#
# Vetted list. tools/build-live.sh applies these files in numeric order with:
#
#     apt-get purge -y --auto-remove <the names below>
#
# The order is part of the verification: this working copy was purged with
# these batches in this order, and the audio anchors were checked after
# every batch. Do not merge or reorder the files.
